<title>HONG KONG: Trading in M.C. Packaging shrs suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in M.C. Packaging shrs suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of cans and bottles maker M.C. Packaging (Hong Kong) Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Monday.  </p>
<p>Shares of M.C. Packaging were unchanged at HK$2.75 each on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
